
Commando's

xya
xya,b
  x: commando
  y: motor left or right (l or not-l)
  a: par1
  b: par2
     a and b : integer

i        :    info, prints:
	        PApp: bat, encoder1, encoder2, gearvalue
		 bat: battery voltage or 100 to indicate error.
                      When 100 reset device
mmx,y    :    set setpoints (small steps)
pmx,y    :    set setpoints
smx      :    set motor speed of a motor
e        :    print corrections, eepromcnt, stepsdone
f        :    print PID values
g        :    print serialnumber, version, gearvalue
Gmg      :    set gearvalue g
X        :    init eeprom data  (after that, set accuval correct again)
Y        :    zero encoders
E        :    print error, save data in eeprom
F        :    save data in eeprom
Sms      :    set serial number and passkey
Z        :    print data collected after command c
r        :    init array tijden.
Pmx,y    :    set P values
Imx,y    :    set I values
Dmx,y    :    set D values

Amx      :    (L) set accuval, (R) get accuval
Tmx      :    test motors. move motor randomly x times
C        :    Calibrate motors (go to end stops)
## testing
tm       :    start (L) of stop (R) timer
qm       :    start (L) if stop (R) motor/encoder
cm       :    control on (L) and off (R)
Om       :    turn power off